7 Financial period upto June 30, 2025, the Company has considered Advanced Material Undertaking as a separate reportable segment in the standalone financial results. Pursuant to the aforesaid NCLT order on demerger of its Advanced Material Undertaking, there is only one material reportable segment of the Company as at September 30, 2025. Hence, in line with the requirements of Ind AS 108, the Company has opted to disclose segment information only in the consolidated financial results and accordingly no separate segment disclosure has been presented in the current results.  &lt;BR&gt; 
